{"path":"memory/scoped_allocator_adaptor/allocate","title":"std::scoped_allocator_adaptor<OuterAlloc,InnerAlloc...>::allocate","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::scoped_allocator_adaptor&lt;OuterAlloc,InnerAlloc...&gt;::</span>allocate","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory/scoped_allocator_adaptor/allocate","section":"memory","kind":"page","summary":"Uses the outer allocator to allocate uninitialized storage.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/scoped_allocator\">&lt;scoped_allocator&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pointer allocate<span class=\"br0\">(</span> size_type n <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pointer allocate<span class=\"br0\">(</span> size_type n, const_void_pointer hint <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Uses the outer allocator to allocate uninitialized storage.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/allocator_traits\"><span class=\"kw705\">std::<span class=\"me2\">allocator_traits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>OuterAlloc<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">allocate</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>outer_allocator<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, n<spa